{"tool_name":"ndpi-export-regions-tool","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The tool exports rectangular regions, defined with the <code>NDP.view 2</code> software (hammatsu) from the highest resolution version of the ndpi-images and saves them as tif-files.</p>\n\n<p>Click the button and select the input folder. The input folder must contain pairs of ndpi and ndpa files. The regions will be exported to a subfolder of the input folder names <code>zones</code>.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The tool exports rectangular regions, defined with the <code>NDP.view 2</code> software (hammatsu) from the highest resolution version of the ndpi-images and saves them as tif-files.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Click the button and select the input folder. The input folder must contain pairs of ndpi and ndpa files. The regions will be exported to a subfolder of the input folder names <code>zones</code>.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-24T11:55:57+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2021-07-05T13:45:21+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[{"cid":null,"comment_count":null,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":null,"last_comment_uid":null,"status":2}],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":5066,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"a8e07f31-0171-4ad8-8204-5dcdb1d54d4b","url":"/taxonomy/term/5066"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1625493899,"last_comment_uid":42,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"B\u00e4cker Volker orcid.org/0000-0002-9129-6403"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":5067,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"964edb5c-7534-4d25-8555-bb05f18d74d5","url":"/taxonomy/term/5067"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"NDPI_Export_Regions_Tool Documentation","uri":"https://github.com/MontpellierRess